      "pattern": "memory_quality_failure",
      "description": "Stored memories lack essential metadata (e.g., timestamps, speaker-role tags, conversational turn boundaries) and are not semantically enriched (no summarization, entity linking, or temporal normalization). As a result, even if retrieved, fragments cannot support reasoning about when events occurred ('last week' → absolute date), what domains are implied (LGBTQ support group → psychology/counseling), or disambiguate references ('my dog' → incomplete subject, no breed/name/context).",
